{
    "title": "LeafSnap Plant Identification",
    "description": "When you discover a beautiful wildflower or unusual-looking shrub, you struggle to discern its genus. Instead of wasting time trawling through websites or asking your gardener friends, why not simply take a snap and have an app do the work for you?\r\nLeafsnap can currently recognize 90% of all known plant and tree species, covering most of the species you will encounter in every country on Earth.\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Free and unlimited snap\r\n- Instantly Identify thousands of plants, flowers, fruits, and trees\r\n- Learn more about plants, including beautiful pictures from around the world\r\n- Quickly identify plants, flowers, trees, and more.\r\n- Smart Plant Finder\r\n- Instant access to a massive Plant Database that constantly learns and adds information on new plant species.\r\n- Keep track of all the plants in your collection\r\n- Reminders for various plant cares (water, fertilizer, rotate, prune, repot, mist, harvest, or custom reminder)\r\n- Plant journal/diary with photos, monitor plant growth\r\n- Track your today and upcoming tasks.\r\n- Stay on top of your plant needs with a Care calendar\r\n- Water Calculator\r\n- Plant Disease Auto Diagnose & Cure: Snap a photo of your sick plant or upload one from your gallery. LeafSnap will quickly diagnose the plant disease and offer detailed treatment information. Your plant doctor is now just a tap away!\r\nMushroom Identification: We're expanding our scope beyond just plants! Our app now effortlessly identifies mushrooms. Learn about different mushroom species.\r\n- Insect Identification: Delve deeper into the world of nature by identifying insects around you. Whether you're a budding entomologist or simply curious about the critters in your backyard, our app has you covered.\r\n- Toxicity identification: identify plants that may be toxic to pets or humans. Use this new feature to scan plants around your home or garden and receive instant safety information. Ensure the well-being of your pets and family by keeping harmful plants away.\r\n\r\nDownload Leafsnap and enjoy identifying flowers, trees, fruits, and plants on the go!",
    "descriptionHTML": "When you discover a beautiful wildflower or unusual-looking shrub, you struggle to discern its genus. Instead of wasting time trawling through websites or asking your gardener friends, why not simply take a snap and have an app do the work for you?<br>Leafsnap can currently recognize 90% of all known plant and tree species, covering most of the species you will encounter in every country on Earth.<br>Features:<br>- Free and unlimited snap<br>- Instantly Identify thousands of plants, flowers, fruits, and trees<br>- Learn more about plants, including beautiful pictures from around the world<br>- Quickly identify plants, flowers, trees, and more.<br>- Smart Plant Finder<br>- Instant access to a massive Plant Database that constantly learns and adds information on new plant species.<br>- Keep track of all the plants in your collection<br>- Reminders for various plant cares (water, fertilizer, rotate, prune, repot, mist, harvest, or custom reminder)<br>- Plant journal/diary with photos, monitor plant growth<br>- Track your today and upcoming tasks.<br>- Stay on top of your plant needs with a Care calendar<br>- Water Calculator<br>- Plant Disease Auto Diagnose &amp; Cure: Snap a photo of your sick plant or upload one from your gallery. LeafSnap will quickly diagnose the plant disease and offer detailed treatment information. Your plant doctor is now just a tap away!<br>Mushroom Identification: We&#39;re expanding our scope beyond just plants! Our app now effortlessly identifies mushrooms. Learn about different mushroom species.<br>- Insect Identification: Delve deeper into the world of nature by identifying insects around you. Whether you&#39;re a budding entomologist or simply curious about the critters in your backyard, our app has you covered.<br>- Toxicity identification: identify plants that may be toxic to pets or humans. Use this new feature to scan plants around your home or garden and receive instant safety information. Ensure the well-being of your pets and family by keeping harmful plants away.<br><br>Download Leafsnap and enjoy identifying flowers, trees, fruits, and plants on the go!",
